      },
      "message": "fix(2d): keep extension out of whole-model islands and note uncut corners\n\nDefault whole-model and stock-source 2D clearing keeps cutters inside\nthe sharp box stock outline, leaving uncut corner material around islands\nsuch as an R5 boss in a 100 x 60 zero-margin plate. Add\nunreached_corners and unreached_corner_note in motion::machining2d,\nexcluding extended air outside setup stock and filtering sub-0.03 mm\npolygon arc noise, and expose non-empty path notes through\nscript::api::op_view so MCP generate and verify report uncut corners.\n\nPopulate AreaCtx::blocked in operation::boundary_ctx for SrcRef::Entity\nand SrcRef::Stock on Pocket, Adaptive2D, and Offset2D using\nslice::material_overhead across ladder planes while leaving islands =\nfalse. Boundary extension now grows only past the exterior stock outline\nwithout cutting into standing part geometry, while explicit inward\noffsets still exercise DepthLaw::Keep.\n\nFixes #2438",
